<title>USA: Galey &amp; Lord Q3 June 28 net edges higher.</title>
<headline>Galey &amp; Lord Q3 June 28 net edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>GALEY &amp; LORD INC</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended   Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			     June 28,  June 29,   June 28,  June 29,</p>
<p>				 1997	  1996	 1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales		  $135,113   $115,437  $375,470 $300,965</p>
<p> Gross profit		 16,274     13,395    42,704   30,700</p>
<p> Net income		   $4,184     $4,051   $11,506   $5,910</p>
<p> Net EPS- primary	    $ .35	$ .34     $ .96    $ .49</p>
<p> Primary shrs outstanding 12,055     11,889    11,990   11,942</p>
<p> Net EPS- Fully Diluted    $ .35	$ .34     $ .95    $ .49</p>
<p> Fully diluted shrs	 12,107     11,889    12,095   11,949</p>
<p>		 (Amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 includes $2.0 million pre-tax or $.10 a share after-tax bad debt reserve taken as a result of a major home fabrics customer filing for bankruptcy protection during the quarter.</p>
<p>Excluding charge, Q3 1997 would have been a record $5.4 million or $.45 compared to net income of $4.1 million or $.34 per common share for the same period last year.</p>
</text>
